WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.900
The standing medium kick is extended with the first Drive Rush cancel.

2
00:00:01.900 --> 00:00:03.600
Forward, back and crouching medium kicks build the conversion.

3
00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:04.750
The second Rush leads into the heavy normals.

4
00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:06.000
Coward Crouch into Wild Lift launches Dee Jay.

5
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:06.900
Medium Vertical Rolling Attack ends the juggle.
